{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1619.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"cd5519eb7b44e624651e167bf207ed0c06b6fd041a43f254f9cea22d279ccdf5","ja":"風花のアドバイス","zh":"风花的建议","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1619.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"6944b65c9d2209cd33b6c6906f5527b0ec436e802b9fffdba4614075cb8f929d","ja":"「それでは撮影開始します！　まずは、\nお好きなようにポーズをとってもらえますか？」","zh":"“那么拍摄要开始了！首先，\n能请您随心摆出喜欢的姿势吗？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1619.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"539abb60ca225844b490da6168bf830b8d8cff0bec5e80f58a1b24d17046a5b2","ja":"はい。それじゃあまずは……。","zh":"好的。那么首先……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1619.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"71454ec1bc9f9dc069eb3a5794b1defcc07c26f6b71b339445a2d7d8cad3b5dd","ja":"こんなポーズは、どうですか？","zh":"摆这个姿势，感觉怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1619.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"a59de29670972e0af57d0d2417437cc128abfa3e3833621632f3c0d8dae75b02","ja":"パシャッパシャッパシャッ！","zh":"咔嚓咔嚓咔嚓！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1619.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"2be41f593f092b3264457bd2e9b57dec95799eed3d00df2657bdb2e916ebb617","ja":"「健康的でいいですね！　じゃあ次は、\nセクシーで挑戦的な視線とポーズ、お願いします！」","zh":"“很有健康活力，非常棒！那么接下来，\n请展现出性感而带有挑衅意味的眼神和姿势！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1619.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4f2733dc9556f510720829d2a7a32388cdd196d5ed34ab845dda1a075503c7a6","ja":"は、はいっ！\nえっと……こ、こんなかんじでしょうか……？","zh":"是、是的！\n那个……这、这样可以吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1619.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"6300e50baf46e8342947b8132fa79ca2bc388c81040d81271b507dd37c64c50c","ja":"「うーん……まだ元気いっぱいすぎるかな？\nできればもうちょっと、しっとりした感じで……」","zh":"“唔——……是不是还有点太活力满满了呢？\n可以的话，希望能再稍微温润、沉静一点……”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1619.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"4a952f0e095f5fc6761a1b21421064c511f4a0e43fc446183a02f5ce211a0a37","ja":"え、えっと……しっとり……？","zh":"呃，那个……湿润……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1619.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"8d9bac9bb0386bf3f1673b5d0d3986a91589c09bfe59a7e126be0ea4dfc9fbb4","ja":"可奈ちゃん、大丈夫？\n苦戦してるみたいだけど……。","zh":"可奈，你没事吧？\n看起来好像陷入苦战了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1619.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"c7df9a869ccf8c527ea1adc8b0a75a572f2d13121c9edb9f042611a4d36ef955","ja":"ふ、風花さ～ん！\nしっとりした感じって、どうすればいいんですか！？","zh":"风、风花姐～！\n那种沉静湿润的感觉，到底该怎么表现才好啊！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1619.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"e40be1840706b2495df004630549feab2a8e675fcaa67fa5a446efa60e3e45b6","ja":"抽象的な指示に応えるのって、難しいよね……。\nよし、それじゃあ、ちょっと見てて。","zh":"要回应抽象的指示，还真挺难的呢……\n好，既然这样，那就稍微看好咯。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1619.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"cf9e0664bc6f57506fdf506491e35caae26ace1b5b5f35f48425174f7ddfacac","ja":"例えばこう、挑戦的な視線をカメラに向けて、\nぐっと前のめりになってみたり……。","zh":"比如像这样，朝镜头投去挑衅的视线，\n身体大幅向前倾之类……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1619.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"9a55b3e4028d7e5d132e92cfc4c32e6683398df7a4c9bee05e406dd76331da57","ja":"座って、体を捻りつつ自信たっぷりな\n笑みを浮かべてみたりとか……どうかな？","zh":"坐下来，扭动身子的同时露出自信满满的\n微笑……这样如何呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1619.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"81c446036fb9a44823a2bd5d75b51d43be5fc42064500165ad74a079f269d95e","ja":"わぁ～！　すっごくセクシーです！\nそんな感じにすればいいんですねっ！","zh":"哇～！这也太性感了！\n只要弄成那种感觉就可以了吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1619.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"f94468adebd5fae6932e299efacbbff52f90570055b62ae1eca3c657fa640740","ja":"私も風花さんみたいに、\nもっと余裕をもって……こう、とか？","zh":"我也想像风花小姐那样，\n显得更有从容气质……像这样，如何？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1619.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"7d8bd60105dcf0c64fb1adfc7d8715b7b5a4d0fca75265dfe9fb172f72699dee","ja":"「おっ、いいですね！\nその感じでいきましょう！」","zh":"「哦，很不错呢！\n就按这个感觉来吧！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1619.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"d8fe7f11ef543613c1328ad8d75158d92db12ee0a086e3f6ca6028e83b82b6be","ja":"やった～！\nどんどんいくぞ～♪　大人可奈～♪","zh":"太棒啦～！\n继续加油冲呀～♪ 成熟可奈～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1619.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"9dfe8aab1ff79b830b7037a62e703eb332f46696fab7ab06a97fed0de78c6761","ja":"（ふふっ♪\nちゃんと助けになれてよかった！）","zh":"（呵呵♪\n能帮上忙真是太好了！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
